{"ref":"BDB, קִנְיָן","hw":"קִנְיָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קִנְיָן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>thing got or acquired, acquisition (</strong>Aramaism, Lag<sup>BN 205</sup><strong>)</strong>; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.12\">Ez 38:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.13\">13</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנְיַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.11\">Lv 22:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנְיָֽנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.7\">Pr 4:7</a> +, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>thing acquired</em> by purchase <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנְיַן כֶּסֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.11\">Lv 22:11</a> (H; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מִקְנָה\" href=\"/BDB,_מִקְנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנָה</a>); of property <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:23\" href=\"/Genesis.34.23\">Gn 34:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:6\" href=\"/Genesis.36.6\">36:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:4\" href=\"/Joshua.14.4\">Jos 14:4</a>; (all P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.12\">Ez 38:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.13\">13</a> (in all disting, from <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנֶה</span> cattle); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:21\" href=\"/Psalms.105.21\">ψ 105:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנֵה קִנְיָנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:18\" href=\"/Genesis.31.18\">Gn 31:18</a> (P; prob. doublet, 𝔊 om.); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכָל־קִנְיָֽנְךָ קְנֵה בִינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.7\">Pr 4:7</a> <em>with</em> (or <em>at the price of</em>) <em>all that thou hast acquired, get understanding</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  more gen.: coll. <em>creatures</em> 𝔊 κτίσις <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:24\" href=\"/Psalms.104.24\">ψ 104:24</a> (cf. √ <strong>1 a</strong>).","next":"BDB, מִקְנֶה²","prev":"BDB, קָנָה"}